From: nomorecoolnicknames <nomorecoolnicknames@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 15:45:15 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] SystemUI: null check for the return value of
 getPackagesForOps()

AppOpsService.getPackagesForOps() returns null when no package has a
recorded op from AppOpsControllerImpl.OPS, which is the normal state on
the first boot after a data wipe. fetchCurrentActiveOps() (added by the
A13 security backport 707fc94ec3df) iterates the result without a check,
so the first SystemUI start crashes with an NPE while creating
KeyguardService:

  Unable to create service com.android.systemui.keyguard.KeyguardService:
  NullPointerException ... List.iterator() on a null object reference
  at AppOpsControllerImpl.setListening(AppOpsControllerImpl.java:12)

(R8 line 12 of setListening maps to fetchCurrentActiveOps():186.)
Seen on the Meizu M5c after a clean install of LineageOS 20.

Backport of AOSP Ifc51678733caf412421c5ea1827668b3698e44e0
("Null check for the return value of getPackagesForOps()", b/324329757),
present in lineage-21.0 as 42f21d60571b. The test is adapted to A13,
where setListening() runs synchronously.

Bug: 324329757
Change-Id: Ifc51678733caf412421c5ea1827668b3698e44e0

diff --git a/packages/SystemUI/src/com/android/systemui/appops/AppOpsControllerImpl.java b/packages/SystemUI/src/com/android/systemui/appops/AppOpsControllerImpl.java
index 1876786b..8c3ed0b9 100644
--- a/packages/SystemUI/src/com/android/systemui/appops/AppOpsControllerImpl.java
+++ b/packages/SystemUI/src/com/android/systemui/appops/AppOpsControllerImpl.java
@@ -183,6 +183,9 @@ public class AppOpsControllerImpl extends BroadcastReceiver implements AppOpsCon
 
     private void fetchCurrentActiveOps() {
         List<AppOpsManager.PackageOps> packageOps = mAppOps.getPackagesForOps(OPS);
+        if (packageOps == null) {
+            return;
+        }
         for (AppOpsManager.PackageOps op : packageOps) {
             for (AppOpsManager.OpEntry entry : op.getOps()) {
                 for (Map.Entry<String, AppOpsManager.AttributedOpEntry> attributedOpEntry :
diff --git a/packages/SystemUI/tests/src/com/android/systemui/appops/AppOpsControllerTest.java b/packages/SystemUI/tests/src/com/android/systemui/appops/AppOpsControllerTest.java
index e6c36c18..cf903d3d 100644
--- a/packages/SystemUI/tests/src/com/android/systemui/appops/AppOpsControllerTest.java
+++ b/packages/SystemUI/tests/src/com/android/systemui/appops/AppOpsControllerTest.java
@@ -170,6 +170,16 @@ public class AppOpsControllerTest extends SysuiTestCase {
         assertThat(mController.getActiveAppOps()).isEmpty();
     }
 
+    /** Regression test for b/324329757 */
+    @Test
+    public void startListening_fetchCurrentActive_nullPackageOps() {
+        when(mAppOpsManager.getPackagesForOps(AppOpsControllerImpl.OPS)).thenReturn(null);
+
+        mController.setListening(true);
+
+        assertThat(mController.getActiveAppOps()).isEmpty();
+    }
+
